<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (Founded in 2006, Securevision is a trusted Security Solutions Specialist with over 18 years of experience in designing, implementing, and maintaining comprehensive security systems. We specialize in upgrading outdated analog intercom systems to state-of-the-art Smart Intercom solutions, offering residents the convenience of mobile apps for remote access, enhanced security features, and seamless integration with modern smart home technologies. As a BizSafe3-certified and Singapore Police Force-approved provider, we are committed to delivering reliable, customized solutions that meet the unique needs of condominiums, ensuring peace of mind for residents and property managers alike.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
